  {
   "line": 3,
   "text": "Rintaro is tall, blond, pierced, and so intimidating that strangers literally run from him.",
   "start": 4.298,
   "end": 9.014
  },
  {
   "line": 4,
   "text": "Which isn't great when your family owns a cake shop.",
   "start": 9.254,
   "end": 11.639
  },
  {
   "line": 5,
   "text": "So when he spots a girl demolishing a mountain of cake, he can't help staring.",
   "start": 11.879,
   "end": 16.154
  },
  {
   "line": 6,
   "text": "She locks eyes with him and bolts out the door.",
   "start": 16.394,
   "end": 18.9
  },
  {
   "line": 7,
   "text": "He's sure he's traumatized her for life.",
   "start": 19.25,
   "end": 21.194
  },
  {
   "line": 8,
   "text": "But the next day she's back, apologizing and insisting on buying him a slice.",
   "start": 21.434,
   "end": 25.413
  },
  {
   "line": 9,
   "text": "So he asks,",
   "start": 25.653,
   "end": 26.39
  },
  {
   "line": 10,
   "text": "\"Wait,",
   "start": 26.67,
   "end": 26.945
  },
  {
   "line": 11,
   "text": "didn't you run because you were scared of me?\"",
   "start": 27.225,
   "end": 29.335
  },
  {
   "line": 12,
   "text": "You see, from HER side, that look was never fear.",
   "start": 30.635,
   "end": 33.863
  },
  {
   "line": 13,
   "text": "No guy had ever stared at her before,",
   "start": 34.123,
   "end": 36.418
  },
  {
   "line": 14,
   "text": "and her heart was POUNDING.",
   "start": 36.618,
   "end": 38.332
  },
  {
   "line": 15,
   "text": "He'd only just noticed her, but she'd noticed him long before that.",
   "start": 38.732,
   "end": 42.545
  },
  {
   "line": 16,
   "text": "He read her face the exact same way EVERYONE reads his.",
   "start": 42.995,
   "end": 46.518
  },
  {
   "line": 17,
   "text": "Then she tells him,",
   "start": 46.778,
   "end": 47.715
  },
  {
   "line": 18,
   "text": "\"I've never once thought you were scary.\"",
   "start": 48.015,
   "end": 49.965
  },
  {
   "line": 19,
   "text": "He's used to people taking one look at his face and running.",
   "start": 50.415,
   "end": 53.231
  },
  {
   "line": 20,
   "text": "He has no idea what to do when someone looks at it...",
   "start": 53.471,
   "end": 56.272
  },
  {
   "line": 21,
   "text": "and stays.",
   "start": 56.902,
   "end": 57.679
  }
 ],
